# P1b-LN (FALLBACK of P1ab-LN when Q1 did not PASS): lifecycle-evict alone on Lever N + prefix reuse, audited profile but no audit-bearing arm (lifecycle-evict reads no KV). exactness-shared is then NOT QUALIFIED for this window
# (the old audit reads the whole pool, ~8.4 minutes a request, and fits no box: docs/prefix-audit-cost.md); running it anyway is the owner's decision (C2_PREFIX_ALLOW_FULL_AUDIT, a separate window).
# READ: the arm verdict PASS; the kill switch latches and the engine restarts in lifecycle-evict (two attaches). A FAIL is NO-GO for the Lever N cutover, as P1ab-LN's.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the region-read pack (tp4-kvread-jobs, docs/prefix-audit-cost.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the window branch and push the job's tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has the order,
# the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags and every rule.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=lifecycle-evict
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-audit-nolna
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_BOX_MINUTES=153
